  <main>
    <section>
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>
        BTC Rewards Dashboard is a developing online platform designed
        to provide a simple mobile-friendly experience for account
        management, task demonstrations and information about online
        earning opportunities.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our goal is to help visitors understand online earning options
        and build a platform that may eventually support legitimate
        revenue-generating activities.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Our Content</h2>
      <p>We aim to publish useful and original information about:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Getting started with online work.</li>
        <li>Translation and language-based opportunities.</li>
        <li>Understanding online earning platforms.</li>
        <li>Protecting accounts and avoiding online scams.</li>
        <li>Using digital tools from a mobile phone.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Information will be developed to help readers make informed
        decisions. We encourage visitors to verify opportunities
        before sharing personal information or spending money.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Transparent Demo Rewards</h2>
      <div class="notice">
        Important: The current mining balances, mining activity,
        withdrawals and task points on this website are simulations.
        They do not represent real Bitcoin, cash or guaranteed income.
        No real Bitcoin is mined or transferred by the demo dashboard.
      </div>
      <p>
        We will clearly identify any future paid opportunities and
        explain their requirements before users participate.
        Real payments would require a legitimate funding source,
        suitable payment arrangements and any necessary approvals.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Advertising and Revenue</h2>
      <p>
        We are exploring legitimate ways to support this website,
        including original content and advertising programmes.
        Advertising participation is subject to provider approval
        and applicable policies.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not promise earnings, and we do not ask visitors to
        click advertisements in exchange for rewards. Any future
        revenue-sharing arrangement will depend on an approved
        programme and actual eligible revenue.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Protect Yourself Online</h2>
      <p>
        Never share your wallet recovery phrase, private keys,
        banking PIN or account password with a website claiming
        to offer rewards. Be cautious of anyone promising guaranteed
        profits or asking you to pay a fee to unlock supposed earnings.
      </p>
    </section>

